  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food security in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food security to vulnerable groups in Sudan. The program is designed to reach women, men, girls, and boys equally. Moreover, the it includes support to women&apos;s organizations that operate &apos;safe spaces&apos; for women and girls who have survived SGBV (Sexual and Gender-Based Violence) and provided psychosocial support, hygiene items, and &apos;dignity kits&apos;.</narrative>
  </description>
